OL,3,APolice watchdog to investigate Met over
OL,4,Aletter about Meghan's father
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK police watchdog is to
OL,7,Finvestigate the Metropolitan Police's
OL,8,Fhandling of a letter containing
OL,9,Fallegations against Thomas Markle that
OL,10,Fwas handed to his daughter, the Duchess
OL,11,Fof Sussex, in 2019.
OL,13,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,14,FConduct (IOPC) said it had decided an
OL,15,Finvestigation was required into the
OL,16,Fforce's "failure to pass on allegations
OL,17,Fof serious offending... to relevant
OL,18,Foverseas authorities at the time".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
