OL,3,APolice watchdog to investigate Met over
OL,4,Aletter about Meghan's father
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe letter, written by Markle's first
OL,7,Fwife Roslyn Loveless, is believed to
OL,8,Fhave contained claims about Meghan's
OL,9,Ffather.
OL,11,FHe has strongly denied recent
OL,12,Fallegations that he had possessed
OL,13,Fimages of child abuse, describing them
OL,14,Fas "sick lies".
